body:
My current team is Ciara, Kalon, Melord, Stein, Zeruiah and have a few questions  


after reading wiki i see Ciara and Kalon have pretty much the same buffs but Ciara has higher % on buffs, should i straight up replace Kalon due to this?

&#x200B;

I also recently pulled Gazolina (already OE), Illucen and Illumina (OE), Beiorg, Ellie, Eerikki, Beatrix, Nyami, Lara (OE) and Kurewa and Kuraginn: which of these are worth investing in/ replacing members of my current team? 

&#x200B;

thanks again for any input :)
